| | `[22 , 9 , 2 , 8]` | **2** (right) | Angle still positive, but the rule *“if w > 3 then action = 2”* over‑rode the angle rule and sent the cart the wrong way. The pole still survived because the angle was small, but the extra right push wastes time. | Angle continues to increase slowly, but the episode still lasts > 250 steps. |
