```text
IF a >  4               → LEFT
ELSE IF a < -4          → RIGHT
ELSE IF a > 0 AND w > 3 → LEFT
ELSE IF a < 0 AND w < -3 → RIGHT
ELSE IF a > 0 AND w < -3 → RIGHT
ELSE IF a < 0 AND w > 3 → LEFT
ELSE                     # pole almost upright
    IF x >  2          → LEFT
    ELSE IF x < -2    → RIGHT
    ELSE IF v >  3    → LEFT
    ELSE IF v < -3    → RIGHT
    ELSE               → RIGHT   # any direction works
```

