---

**Bottom line:**  
The pole’s geometry must drive the action; cart‑position/velocity are only secondary safety nets. The revised hierarchy above corrects the main flaw of the previous policies and should keep the pole balanced for a much longer time. Good luck, and may the pole stay upright! 🚀
