**3. Updated rule set (pseudo‑code)**

```text
#  a  = pole angle
#  w  = pole angular velocity
#  x  = cart position
#  v  = cart velocity

IF w >  2      THEN action = 2          # pole falling right → push right
ELSE IF w < -2 THEN action = 1          # pole falling left  → push left
ELSE IF a >  2 THEN action = 2          # pole tilted right (slow) → push right
ELSE IF a < -2 THEN action = 1          # pole tilted left  (slow) → push left
ELSE IF x > 10 THEN action = 1          # cart too far right → push left
ELSE IF x < -10 THEN action = 2         # cart too far left  → push right
ELSE IF v > 3   THEN action = 1          # cart moving right fast → push left
ELSE IF v < -3  THEN action = 2          # cart moving left fast  → push right
ELSE action = 2                         # neutral (right) when everything is near zero
```

