**2. Revised rule set (new “Balanced‑Pole” controller)**  

The new controller keeps the same *if‑else* structure but changes two things:

* **Neutral default** – a small push toward the centre (right if the cart is left of 0, left if it is right of 0, otherwise no push).  
* **Early‑failure guard** – when the pole is within two degrees of the angular limits (|a| ≥ 23) **and** the angular velocity would push it farther (a·w > 0), we apply the opposite force immediately, even if the angle threshold “≥ 3” would normally select the same direction.

