| `|v| >= 5` | High cart speed can cause overshoot after a corrective push. | Dampens the cart’s motion. |
| **Neutral default** | The previous “always push right” bias made the cart drift right and eventually forced a large correction. | The cart now drifts *toward* the centre or stays still, eliminating systematic drift. |

---

