### 2. Revised rule‑set (new “balanced‑pole” policy)

```text
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Keep the cart away from the track edges
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
IF |x| >= 18:
    # push toward the centre of the track
    ACTION = 1 IF x > 0 ELSE 2          # left if cart is on the right side

# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Dampen pole swing when the pole is already almost upright
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
ELIF |a| <= 2 AND w != 0:
    # push opposite to the angular velocity
