| `[ 5 4 2 -3]` (θ = 2, ω = ‑3) | |θ| < 3, |ω| ≥ 2 → true | 1 (left) | Cancels the negative angular velocity |

In every step the chosen action is exactly the one that nudges the cart **toward the side where the pole tip is falling**, which is the classic “push‑the‑cart‑under‑the‑falling‑tip” intuition.

