3. **Position / velocity safety net** – they are only consulted when the pole is already well‑behaved, so they never override the primary stabilising action.  
4. **Deterministic and easy to implement** – only four simple comparisons are needed; no arithmetic beyond absolute value and sign checks.  

All 74 previous trials that reached the full 500‑step reward used essentially this logic (the “best overall strategy”). The refined thresholds add a little margin for the integer‑only state space (‑50…50) without changing the decision order, so we expect the same perfect success rate.

