| `|x| >= 18` | **push *away* from centre** (right if x>0, left if x<0) | Prevents a sudden opposite acceleration that would destabilise the pole. |
| `|v| >= 2` | **push *with* the current velocity** | Reinforces the current motion, keeping the cart’s momentum smooth. |
| `else` | same “push according to sign of θ” | Provides a deterministic fallback when all variables are small. |

