The only thing that could be improved is **speed of reaction** when the pole is already close to the limits. The current thresholds (|θ| ≥ 3°, |ω| ≥ 2, |x| ≥ 18, |v| ≥ 2) are already generous enough to catch the pole early, but we can make the controller a little more aggressive without sacrificing stability:

