### 3️⃣  Revised, compact rule set  

The “best‑so‑far” rule set already gives perfect performance, but we can tighten it a little (remove the redundant final `else` and make the thresholds symmetric) to make the logic easier to read and to guarantee that **every** step has a deterministic action.

```text
# Thresholds (tuned on the integer‑range environment)
